        2560,
        -976
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Property Turnover - AI Priority & Maintenance Assignment\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow handles a property turnover submission from a form, enriches it with unit profile and historical turnover data from Google Sheets, and uses an AI agent to assess priority and maintenance needs. It then generates a turnover job with SLA details, records it, finds an appropriate technician, and sends notifications through Gmail and Slack. Finally, it updates the job record to show that it has been assigned.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Turnover Form fields so submissions provide the required unit ID and turnover report details.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and verify the referenced sheets contain unit profiles, turnover history, turnover jobs, and technician assignment data.\n- Configure the Google Gemini Chat Model credentials and confirm the AI agent prompt and structured output parser match the expected priority, SLA, and maintenance assignment fields.\n- Connect Gmail credentials and set the recipient/message template for maintenance emails.\n- Connect Slack credentials and select the workspace/channel or user used for maintenance notifications.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the AI assessment prompt, structured output schema, SLA rules, technician lookup criteria, notification templates, and the Google Sheets columns used for job tracking."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
